---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'DMC Services | Malaysian Food Tour Operator B2B',
  description: 'Culinary Travel Experts is a destination management company specializing in food and cultural experiences across Malaysia. FIT groups, small groups, large groups. MOTAC application in progress.',
  image: 'https://cdn.simplyenak.com/payload-media/hand-dipping-lumpia-in-penang-laksa.jpg',
  canonical: 'https://culinarytravelexperts.com/dmc-services',
  robots: {
    index: true,
    follow: true,
  },
};
---

<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'ProfessionalService',
  name: 'Culinary Travel Experts',
  description: "Malaysia's culinary destination management company specializing in food and cultural experiences for travel professionals.",
  url: 'https://culinarytravelexperts.com/dmc-services',
  telephone: '+60 17-287 8929',
  email: 'hello@culinarytravelexperts.com',
  address: {
    '@type': 'PostalAddress',
    addressLocality: 'Kuala Lumpur',
    addressCountry: 'MY'
  },
  areaServed: [
    { '@type': 'City', 'name': 'Kuala Lumpur' },
    { '@type': 'City', 'name': 'Penang' },
    { '@type': 'City', 'name': 'Ipoh' },
    { '@type': 'City', 'name': 'Melaka' },
    { '@type': 'Place', 'name': 'Cameron Highlands' },
    { '@type': 'City', 'name': 'Johor Bahru' }
  ],
  serviceType: ['Tour Operator', 'Destination Management Company', 'Food Tour Provider'],
  provider: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'Culinary Travel Experts',
    parentOrganization: {
      '@type': 'Organization',
      name: 'Simply Enak'
    }
  },
  hasOfferCatalog: {
    '@type': 'OfferCatalog',
    name: 'B2B Travel Services',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'Offer', itemOffered: { '@type': 'Service', name: 'FIT Food Tours' } },
      { '@type': 'Offer', itemOffered: { '@type': 'Service', name: 'Group Food Experiences' } },
      { '@type': 'Offer', itemOffered: { '@type': 'Service', name: 'Corporate Events' } }
    ]
  },
  agentRange: '2-200 travelers',
  pricing: {
    '@type': 'PriceSpecification',
    priceCurrency: 'MYR',
    minPrice: 285,
    maxPrice: 359
  }
})} />

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">DMC Services</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted mb-8">
        Your clients' food requests, handled end to end. Groups from 2 to 200.
      </p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>Kinds of requests we handle</h2>
        <p>
          The request never arrives as a clean package. It arrives as a problem: a halal-only group that still wants the full hawker experience. A CEO who wants to cook, not eat. A 40-person incentive group that needs three simultaneous market walks. A client who cannot eat gluten but is visiting the noodle capital of Asia.
        </p>
        <p>
          We handle these. Since 2011 we have matched complex requests to the right vendors, guides, and timing, and we do it quietly, so the client just experiences the food.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <!-- TBD (verify before deploy): 48h confirmation, same-day urgent handling,
             1:8 guide ratio, pre-planned contingencies, and payment-term details are
             OPERATIONAL CLAIMS written from strategy docs, not yet confirmed. -->
        <h2>How we operate</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Booking window:</strong> Most experiences confirmed within 48 hours. Urgent requests handled same-day where vendor availability allows.</li>
          <li><strong>Guide ratio:</strong> One guide per 8 guests on walking tours, scaled up with multi-guide coordination for larger groups. Every guide is trained in food safety and cultural interpretation.</li>
          <li><strong>Vendor relationships:</strong> We only send clients to vendors we know personally. If a vendor cannot host on your date, we say so before you commit, and we offer a vetted alternative.</li>
          <li><strong>Contingency:</strong> Rain plans, market closures, and vendor emergencies are pre-planned per tour. Your clients are never left standing at a locked gate.</li>
          <li><strong>Dietary coordination:</strong> Halal, vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, allergies, all confirmed with vendors before arrival. We do not improvise dietary needs on the day.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment terms:</strong> Clear invoicing in MYR or your currency. Deposit structure agreed in the supplier agreement, no surprises at settlement.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">FIT Groups</h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-4">2-8 travelers</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Private guides, custom itineraries, flexible scheduling. Your clients eat where we eat, at the stalls and kitchens we have visited for years.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Small Groups</h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-4">8-20 travelers</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Join-in tours, team building, incentive programs. We handle the logistics so you can focus on the experience.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-card p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Large Groups</h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-4">20-200 travelers</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Corporate events, FAM trips, conference add-ons. Multi-guide coordination, vendor management, full operational support.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>What We Cover</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Guides:</strong> English, Malay, Mandarin, Cantonese-speaking. All trained in food safety and cultural interpretation.</li>
          <li><strong>Transport:</strong> Air-con vehicles for pickup and drop-off. We handle all logistics.</li>
          <li><strong>Food:</strong> All meals and drinks included. Every vendor we work with meets our quality standards.</li>
          <li><strong>Dietary:</strong> Halal, vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, allergies, we coordinate with vendors before the tour.</li>
          <li><strong>Language:</strong> Multi-lingual guides, translated materials, pre-tour communication in your clients' language.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>Our Coverage</h2>
        <p>
          We operate across six cities, each with deep food culture and distinct culinary traditions:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Kuala Lumpur:</strong> Street food from three cultures, wet markets, family-run hawker stalls</li>
          <li><strong>Penang:</strong> George Town heritage food, Nyonya home cooking, fishing villages</li>
          <li><strong>Ipoh:</strong> White coffee, bean sprout chicken, Hakka cuisine</li>
          <li><strong>Melaka:</strong> Baba Nyonya heritage, Portuguese Eurasian dishes, Jonker Street vendors</li>
          <li><strong>Cameron Highlands:</strong> Family-run tea plantations, strawberry farms, highland cuisine</li>
          <li><strong>Johor Bahru:</strong> Laksa Johor, murtabak, southern Malaysia food culture</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- TBD: case study needs verification before publishing. The 45-person
           European food industry delegation story is not yet confirmed. -->
      <!-- <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <h2>Case Study: European Food Industry Delegation</h2>
        <p>
          Last year, we hosted a 45-person delegation from a European food industry association...
        </p>
      </div> -->

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section id="contact" class="py-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Get a Quote</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 max-w-4xl">
          <form>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <input type="text" placeholder="Name" required class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default" />
              <input type="email" placeholder="Email" required class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default" />
              <textarea placeholder="Tell us about the request" rows="4" class="block w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-accent focus:border-accent text-default"></textarea>
              <button type="submit" class="px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-secondary transition-colors cursor-pointer">Get a Quote</button>
            </div>
          </form>
          <div class="space-y-8">
            <div><h3 class="font-bold font-heading text-lg">Email</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1"><a href="mailto:hello@culinarytravelexperts.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@culinarytravelexperts.com</a></p></div>
            <div><h3 class="font-bold font-heading text-lg">Based In</h3><p class="text-muted mt-1">Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-muted mt-4 text-sm">We respond within 24 hours. Custom proposals available.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

